		 * NevergrowtheMuCfixedarena orpublishuntrackedpayload bytes. *//* supported rates *//* XXX: better way to check this? *//* XXX: how about DS ? *//* TODO: ATIM window *//* IBSS/TIM *//* tim length *//* DTIM count *//* DTIM period *//* bitmap control *//* Partial virtual bitmap *//* tx power would be updated in macfw *//* link margin is always 0 in beacon*//* VHT capability *//* VHT Operation element *//* QTN 2.4G band VHT IE *//*-
