 * Add 802.11n HT Information IE
 *//* back ptr to common state *//* set byte 1 *//* set channel width *//*
	 * Std 802.11ac-2013, 10.39.1 'Basic VHT BSS functionality': A VHT
	 * AP shall set the RIFS Mode field in the HT Operation element to 0.
	 *//* Rx RIFS is supported *//* set S-PSMP support *//* Deprecated in current draft 11.0 */// 	byteval |= (htinfo->byte1 & IEEE80211_HTINFO_B1_CONTROLLED_ACCESS);/* set service level granularity and secondary channel offset *//* Deprecated in current draft 11.0 *///IEEE80211_HTINFO_B1_SET_SIGRANULARITY(ie,htinfo->sigranularity);///* set byte 2 *//* set op mode *//* set OBSS *//* 20/40 MHZ mode *//* 20 MHZ only HT STA is present *//*
		 * If nonHT, 20MHz, 'nonHT in other BSS' stations counts are all 0, then we have
