 *//*
 * IEEE 802.11 protocol support.
 *//* XXX tunables *//* pkts / 100ms *//* pkts / 100ms *//* IEEE80211_S_INIT *//* IEEE80211_S_SCAN *//* IEEE80211_S_AUTH *//* IEEE80211_S_ASSOC *//* IEEE80211_S_RUN *//* initialize management frame handlers *//* TKIP MIC failure report from the lower layers *//* XXX not used yet *//* Zero indicates no limit on bcst pps *//* Initilze the timeout functions for non-HT and non-ERP protection *//* Initialize the timeout function for non-HT protection *//* Initialize the timeout function non-ERP protection *//* protocol state change handler *//*
	 * This should not be needed as we detach when reseting
	 * the state but be conservative here since the
	 * authenticator may do things like spawn kernel threads.
	 *//*
