	 *//*
 * Simple-minded authenticator module support.
 *//* XXX well-known names *//* IEEE80211_AUTH_NONE *//* IEEE80211_AUTH_OPEN *//* IEEE80211_AUTH_SHARED *//* IEEE80211_AUTH_8021X	 *//* IEEE80211_AUTH_AUTO *//* IEEE80211_AUTH_WPA *//*
 * Setup internal authenticators once; they are never unregistered.
